!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hide players who aren't on your friends list!</li></ul>", "short_description": "In a game where you can't stop moving, every step is progress. But whether that progress is forward or backward, that is up to you...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361080/header.jpg?t=1730771163", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730771163", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730771163", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 or Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB vram<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 or Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1.5 GB vram<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Tripp Rainey", "Brice DiPiazza"], "publishers": ["Trippster Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 3314910, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [848552], "pack